<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 19.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 19.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Radio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Defence Minister Andrus Oovel insists that army officers have a higher civilian education.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
